31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think... I think Ryuji might be the werewolf.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, that's a very bold claim for the first day. Why?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Oh? The quiet one speaks up first. How interesting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,See! I knew something was off! I'm with Daisuke on this!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, that is a serious accusation. Do you have proof, or is this a guess?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I can't say exactly how, but I'm almost sure.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Daisuke is the Seer, he knows. But if he's the wolf, he's framing Ryuji.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. It's a classic play. Though Ryuji's silence is also a bit too perfect.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji, answer the question! Why are you acting so cool?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am simply asking for a reason. Accusing me without evidence is illogical.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,Please... believe me. I'm trying to help the village.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, if you are the Seer, you've already found the wolf. Is that it?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If he is, we win now. If he isn't, we're just killing a villager.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I trust Daisuke! He's too nervous to be a werewolf!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Trusting someone because they seem ""nervous"" is not a rational strategy, Takumi.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Over"",""raw"":""Over.""}],""raw"":""Over.""}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I'll trust Daisuke's intuition for now. It seems too specific.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll go with the flow. Let's see if Ryuji can talk his way out.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
